  "url": "/ShowUserReviews-g2486879-d1063944-r1031229663-Wattle_Grove_Motel-Wattle_Grove_Greater_Perth_Western_Australia.html",
  "title": "Excellent stay",
  "language": "en",
  "originalLanguage": "en",
  "roomTip": null,
  "text": "Had a room for 20 nights and would not have stayed if there was anything lacking.  Room spotless, cleaned every day with fresh (good quality) towels, very comfortable bed with good quality bedding, very hot water with enough pressure to clean a car, good and constant WiFi.  Grounds constantly being cleaned.  Ate at the bar & grill and the food was good quality and a lot of it!  The pool looked crystal clear (not the right time of year) and the children’s play area clean.  Would definately stay next family trip and recommend family to do so.  Oh and very professional reception staff.",
