  "url": "/ShowUserReviews-g2486879-d1063944-r916628179-Wattle_Grove_Motel-Wattle_Grove_Greater_Perth_Western_Australia.html",
  "title": "BE WARNED! YOUR BOOKING WILL BE CANCELLED ON YOU!",
  "language": "en",
  "originalLanguage": "en",
  "roomTip": null,
  "text": "Absolutely appalling service and professionalism at The Wattle Grove!! Our families have patronaged this motel for 20 years. But never again!! I had booked on the phone a few weeks ago and paid in full!! Great I thought and a confirmation was sent to my email. We are a retired couple and had just travelled from Geraldton,  not a long way for some but at our age it is!! We arrived mid afternoon to check in. We were told that we didn't have a room available.  Then they told us it was for night before!! That was an out and out lie. I had proof from the email we had the correct day!! Absolutely disgusting by this motel. Be warned everyone!! ",
  "username": "Tania  W",
  "connectionToSubject": null,
  "absoluteUrl": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g2486879-d1063944-r916628179-Wattle_Grove_Motel-Wattle_Grove_Greater_Perth_Western_Australia.html",
