  "url": "/ShowUserReviews-g2486879-d1063944-r878748328-Wattle_Grove_Motel-Wattle_Grove_Greater_Perth_Western_Australia.html",
  "title": "Appalling service.",
  "language": "en",
  "originalLanguage": "en",
  "roomTip": null,
  "text": "I’ve just had the most ridiculous experience with the management of this motel, I felt others need to be aware.\n\nAfter booking a room online for a night next month I received the usual confirmation, then I received another email advising me that I was required to send them a photograph of my credit card and drivers licence.  This is despite my credit card payment having already been processed.\n\nI phoned and said I was uncomfortable providing those details due to the high risk of identity fraud, I was advised it was the law (it is not).  I finally offered to provide my drivers licence number and the last digits of my credit card, apparently this was not sufficient.\n\nI was arriving after hours and had not stayed here before, my booking was cancelled.  In all the hundreds of places I’ve stayed all over Australia I’ve never been subjected to this stupid level of protocol.\n\nA thoroughly unpleasant experience.\n\n",
  "username": "Aussieretired1",
  "connectionToSubject": null,
  "absoluteUrl": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g2486879-d1063944-r878748328-Wattle_Grove_Motel-Wattle_Grove_Greater_Perth_Western_Australia.html",
