  "language": "en",
  "originalLanguage": "en",
  "roomTip": null,
  "text": "Stayed here with our two young children and the room was lovely and clean and the beds are so comfortable. Fully air conditioned with free wifi and also has Foxtel, which was a nice touch. Nice and quiet area, with an awesome wee park and a swimming pool. We ordered room service pizza and it was just delicious. Definitely reccomended for families. ",
